config BR2_PACKAGE_AR8030_TOOLS
	bool "ar8030-tools"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_AR8030
	select BR2_PACKAGE_LIBUSB
	help
	  Userspace daemon and diagnostic/pairing tools for the Artosyn
	  AR8030 baseband/RF link (built from the same yz_host_drv SDK as
	  package/ar8030's kernel module):

	  - ar8030-daemon: owns the USB-attached AR8030 once its firmware
	    is running, exposes an RPC service other tools talk to.
	  - bb_pair: baseband pairing/binding with an AR8030-equipped
	    air unit.
	  - ar8030_usb_test_tool: basic USB-level diagnostics.
